   - Cube Core / Bevel: #191C24 (Dark Slate / Structural Bevels)
   - Face 1 (Primary) : #EBB434 (Axé Gold - Up / Y+)
   - Face 2 (Secondary): #00D2D3 (Maré Teal - Front / Z+)
   - Face 3 (Reject)   : #EE5253 (Terra Red - Right / X+)
   - Face 4 (Neutral)  : #E6E6E6 (Neutral Light - Down / Y-)
   - Face 5 (Indigo)   : #3B3B58 (Deep Indigo - Left / X-)
   - Face 6 (Amber)    : #C98E1A (Muted Amber - Back / Z-)
=============================================================================
"""

